			"color":"#232",
			"widgets_values":[
				"### 阶段一：锁定剧本\n\n1. **一句话梗概**：年轻妈妈辅导儿子写作业快要崩溃，儿子却用严密的逻辑和“良心”疯狂反击。\n2. **目标总时长与画幅**：30秒，16:9。\n3. **视觉基调**：现代家庭，写实喜剧，温馨暖调室内光线。\n4. **角色表**：\n   * **Role 1**：年轻妈妈，30多岁，急躁崩溃，穿米色毛衣和牛仔裤。\n   * **Role 2**：小男孩，8岁左右，淡定固执，穿绿白拼接T恤。\n5. **Scene 1**：\n   * 地点：客厅书桌前。\n   * 时间：晚上。\n   * 剧情功能：展现辅导作业的母子冲突。\n   * 时长：30秒。\n   * 素材：书桌、台灯、作业本、铅笔。\n\n---\n\n### 阶段三：最终输出格式\n\n```text\nScene 总时长：30秒\n\nGlobal prompt：\nRole 1: [East Asian woman in her 30s, frustrated expression, dark hair tied in low ponytail, wearing beige knit sweater and blue jeans].\nRole 2: [East Asian boy around 8 years old, calm expression, short dark hair, wearing green and white raglan t-shirt].\nbackground: [Warmly lit modern living room, wooden desk with notebooks, pencils, desk lamp, sofa in background, photos on wall]. Audio contains only [spoken language and positive diegetic ambience].\n\n[Medium two-shot]. [Role 1 stands with hand on hip, looking down at Role 2 seated at desk]. \n[0 to 3 second Role 1 sighs and points at notebook]. Role 1 says in frustrated tone, \"每次一说你就这个态度，那你写错了还不能说呀？给你辅导一次作业，我起码少活半年！\"\n[3 to 6 second cut to close-up of Role 2 looking up]. Role 2 says calmly, \"不可能。\" Role 1 asks, \"啥不可能啊？\"\n\n[Over-the-shoulder shot over Role 1's shoulder]. [Role 2 looks at Role 1].\n[6 to 10 second Role 2 holding pen, shaking head slightly]. Role 2 says in serious tone, \"你要辅导一次，就少活半年。那你应该早就没了。\" \n\n[Medium close-up]. [Role 1 leans closer to the desk].\n[10 to 18 second Role 1 taps the notebook with her finger]. Role 1 says in impatient tone, \"这有这么难吗？你看，让你用象造句，你可以写：妈妈像天使，妈妈像明星，这不都行吗？随便写呀。\"\n\n[Reaction close-up]. [Role 2 stares directly at Role 1].\n[18 to 24 second Role 2 puts down the pen]. Role 2 says in firm tone, \"这是造句，不是造谣。\" Role 1 retorts, \"你甭管是造句还是造谣，就这么写，\" Role 2 replies, \"写不了。\"\n\n[Medium two-shot]. [Role 1 and Role 2 facing off].\n[24 to 30 second Role 1 throws hands up]. Role 1 asks, \"怎么写不了呀？\" Role 2 touches his chest and says, \"昧着良心写，我的良心会痛的！\" Role 1 covers her face in despair, saying, \"哎哟，我的妈！\"\nAudio contains [pencil scratching, paper rustling] and spoken [Chinese] dialogue.\n```\n\n**最后验证：**\n- Scene 时长：30秒（符合拆分）。\n- 没有远景人物：全部使用 Medium 和 Close-up。\n- 人物互相对视：已标明看向对方。\n- 明确说话者及语气：已标注。\n- LTX 标点：已全部转换为 ASCII。\n- 声音：仅有正向环境音和对白，无背景音乐。"
			],
